        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSimplify the expression [MATH: \\dfrac {p^7} {p^2} \\cdot p^3 .]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst we apply the quotient rule, subtracting exponents in the fraction:\n\n[MATH: (p^{7})/(p^{2}) \u22c5 p^{3}|=; p^{(7 \u2212 2)} \u22c5 p^{3}|=; p^{5} \u22c5 p^{3}]\n\nThen we apply the product rule, adding exponents in the product:\n\n[MATH: p^{5} \u22c5 p^{3}|=; p^{(5 + 3)}|=; p^{8}]\n\nTherefore,\n\n[MATH: (p^{7})/(p^{2}) \u22c5 p^{3} = p^{8}.]"
