        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nSimplify the expression\n[MATH: (x^{5})/(x^{3}) \u22c5 x^{5}.]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: x^{7}]\nb. [MATH: x^{22}]\nc. [MATH: x^{2}]\nd. [MATH: x^{10}]\ne. [MATH: x^{5}]"
